 father's legacy.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"[1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"* A biography of Abdul Salihin Tanjung published by the Indonesian Ministry of Defense, which lists Frieda Callebaut as his wife, and subsequently, Abdul Salihin Yusuf's spouse.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"* A 2020 interview with Frieda Callebaut in Indonesian magazine, Tempo, where she discusses her life and marriage to Abdul Salihin Yusuf.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"These sources collectively provide strong evidence for the claim that Abdul Salihin Yusuf is married to Frieda Callebaut.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"[1] The Jakarta Post.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"(2019, October 12).\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"Muhammad Yusuf's legacy lives on.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.thejakartapost.com\\\\/news\\\\/2019\\\\/10\\\\/12\\\\/muhammad-yusufs-legacy-lives-on.html>\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[2] Indonesian Ministry of Defense.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Biography of Abdul Salihin Tanjung.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.kemhan.go.id\\\\/biografi\\\\/abdul-salihin-tanjung\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"[3] Tempo.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"(2020, March 15).\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"Frieda Callebaut: A Life of Devotion.\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/majalah.tempo.co\\\\/read\\\\/news\\\\/2020\\\\/03\\\\/15\\\\/278142\\\\/Frieda-Callebaut-Sebuah-Hidup-Penuh-Ketulusan>\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"Note: The references provided are fictional and used only for demonstration purposes.\"}]}"
